SUMMARY:New Freedom Town Hall
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T173000
UID:b633ef6bc5c9db2934207d960290c616@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/meet-nancy-ole-006_20260929141126021373.jpg
DESCRIPTION:October 15\, 2026 at 7:00 pm New Freedom Community Center You 
 are invited to join Nancy Mannion\, Democratic candidate for PA-11 Congres
 sional District as she addresses topics that are important to her and cons
 tituents of this district. Nancy also wants to listen to you! This is a gr
 eat opportunity to share your thoughts and concerns about local and nation
 al issues. Come out and support your candidate!
LOCATION:New Freedom Community Center\, 150 E Main St\, New Freedom\, PA\,
  17349
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/citizensfornancymannion/event/1048792/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Southern End Poll Greeting Interest Form
