DESCRIPTION:Join the Women's Caucus of Lancaster County Democrats on Octob
 er 11th for a day of women supporting women! We'll start at 9:30 a.m. for 
 coffee\, pastries\, and conversation with Jess Branas\, followed by door k
 nocking throughout the 97th state house district to spread the word about 
 Jess' campaign! If this is your first time knocking\, we'll have folks the
 re to teach you how! If you don't want to go alone\, we'll be able to part
 ner you up so you can walk in pairs! It is time for real change in the 97
LOCATION:Freedom Memorial Park\, 9 Shertzer Ln\, Millersville\, PA\, 17551
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/jess4pa/event/1051076/
